  (text "ADDR uses an internal ADC to check\nthe voltage on the pin to determine\nthe last three bits of the 7-bit I2C\naddress (1:1:0:0:A2:A1:A0).\nSetting ADDR to GND = 1:1:0:0:0:0:0\nSetting ADDR to VIN = 1:1:0:0:1:1:1\nFor other values and resistor divider\nsetup, see the DS for details." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 177.8 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.5113)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "85589faa-43fb-4c8e-a6b7-306c2c57c8e2"))
